    "description": "<h2>Type</h2><p>Ad-hoc client support request (not part of planned build scope).</p><h2>Request</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Requested by:</strong> Emily (WagerTech), 2026-09-22 2:26 PM ET, in the shared Slack channel.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ask:</strong> Help to log in (screenshot in thread). Emily needed a temporary verification code.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slack (client):</strong> https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790101572565639</p></li></ul><h2>Issue</h2><ul><li><p>To generate the temporary verification code, the Jumpr admin must complete identity verification.</p></li><li><p>Taryn and Kobi both got stuck in a login loop at that step. The 1Password shared passkey did not trigger for this verification (it works on normal login). Dev console showed a 404.</p></li><li><p>Kobi suspected the cause was related to the org being a sandbox. <strong>Not confirmed.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Slack (internal):</strong> https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BRW5L8SUA/p1790104605128129</p></li></ul><h2>Resolution</h2><p>Kobi fixed it at approx. 4:30 PM ET:</p><ol><li><p>Updated <strong>Session Settings</strong> and <strong>Identity Provider</strong> settings to allow <strong>passkey as High Assurance</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Fully logged out, closed the browser, and logged back in.</p></li><li><p>Generated the temporary verification code and sent it to Emily in Slack (valid up to 24 hours).</p></li></ol><p><strong>Root cause unknown.</strong> Step 2 alone may have been enough, but Taryn also did a full logout and browser restart without success. Kobi to add comments with more detail on the fix.</p><h2>Follow-ups</h2><ul data-local-id=\"3b233a56-3e67-4cc1-a84f-26e13bde0bdc\" data-type=\"task-list\"><li data-local-id=\"cc9d2456-69eb-485b-9fbb-df34ab2ce5ff\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Confirm Emily logged in successfully.</li><li data-local-id=\"dcc92516-6cfc-4122-89dd-c06f189b4143\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Confirm which org the settings change was made in, and whether it should stay in place.</li><li data-local-id=\"3c6475bb-e6c7-4100-b05b-460692451499\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Document the steps as a runbook in case this happens again.</li></ul>",
